WEBVTT

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.240
I'm Yakumo Fujii.
I'm sixteen years old.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.080
I was an ordinary high school
student but then...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.780
using immortality magic,
a Sanjiyan Unkara called Pai...

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.250
saved my life.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.780
Yakumo!! Hurry up!

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.650
Alright!

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.060
Pai longs to become human, but...

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.030
the Statue of Humanity,
which is required to make it so...

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.630
has disappeared into the sky
along with the transmitter...

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:46.730
attached by Ling-Ling of
the Yogekisha Corporation.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.170
So, I asked Ling-Ling
to keep up the search for the statue...

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.120
while Pai and I return
to a normal life in Japan.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:52.790
Hey, Pai! Breakfast is ready!
Time to wake up!

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:57.310
Hey, Pai! How long
do you plan on sleeping?

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.240
What are you looking at?

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.150
It's a picture of Yakumo.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:07.880
Well... that?

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.750
That's a photo from
when we went touring.

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:13.620
Who are they?

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.990
Just the gang.

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:16.420
The gang?

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:21.460
Like... the people I go to school with,
you know, we hang out, talk...

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:24.230
and go on road trips together.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.430
It's what's you call a gang.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.810
You mean your friends.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.540
What? You know that word?

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.080
Of course, Pai also has friends.

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:39.670
Stupid! Don't take it out in here!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.230
So this is your friend?

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.770
I don't want to wake up
to that thing's face.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.100
Well, I'm off to school.

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:08.980
Pai wants to go, too.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:10.350
Oh no!!

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:13.080
I'll be back soon, so please
be good and wait here.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.760
Oh yeah... I forgot,
now I have to walk to school.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:23.750
I'd better hurry.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.530
They'll be surprised when I tell them
I've become an immortal hero.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:51.260
Well, just like I said before...

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.920
Immortal hero my ass!?

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:54.760
You idiot!!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.260
That's a lame excuse for skipping
out on our road trip.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:03.360
Don't talk to me like that! I tell you
I was fighting evil in Hong Kong!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:04.540
Oh really!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.930
Do you have fever?

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.110
Hide!

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.540
Hey, Monkey!
You believe me, don't you?

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.580
If it's true, than where's my
souvenir from Hong Kong.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.050
You guys don't believe me do you?!

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.710
Hey! You four over there!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.750
This is all your fault.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:31.730
Just back to school and
you're already in trouble.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.800
Hey, Natsuko!
It's good to see you!

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:37.800
What do you mean good to see me?!

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:40.500
After you took off to
Hong Kong without us...

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.660
we're not friends anymore.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:43.840
Natsuko!!!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.400
Just joking!

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:48.610
Since I'm not really mad let's
take a final road trip together.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.940
Tadaaa!

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:51.810
We can't.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.620
Not only did this fool
sneak off to Hong Kong...

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:59.320
he also ruined his scooter
and went into debt.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.120
A road trip is out of the question.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:03.750
I'm sorry...

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.430
You're the lowest!!!

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.630
How's it look?

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.410
OK
We should be able to fix it!

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.870
Lucky!

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:20.480
If it works, well go to Karuizawa
two weeks from Saturday!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.840
Alright then! Let's get started!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.080
That plug's still good. Clean it up!

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:28.850
Hey Fujii!

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:31.350
I found a seat cushion,
what do you think?

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:34.550
Hey! Yakumo!
Can you get the rust off this?

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:36.460
OK, OK, OK.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.000
Oh, Yakumo!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.390
I'm kinda thirsty...

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.760
Oh, me too.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:42.920
Me too!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.170
Oh, suddenly
I'm everyone's servant.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.470
What are you grinning at?

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:56.440
Seeing the old gang's teamwork,
really makes me feel I'm in Japan.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.580
Oh god!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.880
Don't be weird!
Hurry up and get the drinks!

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:03.180
OK, I'm going!

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.520
A road trip in two weeks...

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:07.820
Sounds like fun.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:09.720
You indolent fool!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.070
Pai!

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:19.800
Sanjiyan?

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.600
Why are you wasting your time?

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:25.240
What happened to your promise
to make Pai human?

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:28.610
But... the Statue of Humanity
is gone now.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.350
There's nothing I can do about it
even if I went back to Hong Kong.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:32.850
Besides, I've got school.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:35.350
Yakumo, leave this place.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:39.590
You're a Wu now,
if you try to live like a human...

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.620
if you continue on in this way,
you will only create misery.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.390
Th... that can't be...

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.930
Fujii!

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:53.530
Hey, what are you doing?
Hurry up and bring the drinks!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:54.760
Oh... yeah.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.100
Understood Yakumo?

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.610
In less than two weeks you won't
be able to carry on this life.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.880
Unbelievable!
Did you see that?

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:07.380
Sanjiyan...

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:10.820
Who was that girl?
She had tree eyes.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.250
Natsuko... she's...

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.740
Look out, Natsuko!

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:56.590
You... not Sanjiyan.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:07:59.930
Bastard!

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.440
What the hell are you?!
Let Natsuko go!

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:09.340
You are Wu?
Where is Sanjiyan?

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:12.440
Sanjiyan?
What do you want with Sanjiyan?

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:16.210
Eat her flesh.
Drink her blood, like so.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.120
Stop!!!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.710
Fujii!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.620
Natsuko!

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.160
Noisy brat!

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:32.700
No!!!

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.840
For a Wu, you're pathetic!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.980
Y... you!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:43.210
Get away from her...

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:56.160
Tell me where to find the Sanjiyan,
and I will spare the girl.

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:08.600
Don't get carried away, lowlife!

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.240
Sa... Sanjiyan.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:14.370
I found you.
You look so delicious.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.650
I will eat you
and become immortal.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:20.980
Once immortal,
I will rule this world.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.750
That's typical lowlife mentality.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.670
Natsuko!

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.440
Are you OK, Natsuko?!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:51.870
Hey!

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:18.810
Natsuko, you're not hurt?
That's good... that's...

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:37.260
Now you see.
You must leave this place with me.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.630
What're you talking about!?

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:44.670
Pai has this Sanjiyan
popping out all of the sudden...

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:46.770
what am I suppose
to do about it?

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.730
Mama!
Mama, you in there?

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.630
Quiet!
Don't bang on my door!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.400
Yakumo, it's you?

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:23.340
Don't answer the door like that!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.310
Your facial pack
nearly scared me to death.

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:28.240
Immortal or not.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.870
This is pretty bad.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:35.750
Did you report it to the police?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.510
I'd like to avoid the police...

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:40.020
because Pai might have done this.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.620
Pai's over at my place.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:47.260
I found her slumped in the doorway,
half-starved, so I let her in.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.630
Mama... the truth is...

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.930
I can't believe it.

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:03.480
Pai is a dual personality
three-eyed demon and you're immortal.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:06.210
I still can't believe it myself...

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:08.040
But truth is truth.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:11.890
You've been an idiot since you were
little kid, but not a liar.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:15.250
Besides, no liar would make up
a story that ridiculous.

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:22.360
So you think Pai, possessed of
that demon, trashed your room?

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.060
My father's the one
who loved demons.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.100
Why is this happening to me?

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:32.780
I don't think you
can go back anymore.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:35.940
Pai is right.

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:40.680
As long as you're not human,
you can never live a normal life.

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:42.680
That can't be...

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:45.720
This is a small and dingy town.

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:50.120
People here work hard, just to
hang on to their small dreams.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:55.090
A hard life isn't so bad
but why not leave...

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:56.960
this hard life.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:40.580
Hey!

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:45.170
Where did you guys go after that?!
I've been looking for you!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.250
Just kidding!

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:51.450
Thanks for yesterday,
that scooter works great.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.280
Karuizawa will be awesome!

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:58.620
I... I've got things to do,
I'll see you later.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.130
Yeah... me too.

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:09.770
Hey! Natsuko!

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.370
Feeling better?

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.940
No!!!

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:22.720
No...

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:26.820
What happened?
What's wrong?

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:30.990
I'm sorry...

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:35.200
Natsuko.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:41.840
No way!
Is that true?

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:44.010
It's true!

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:48.640
This bridge fell on Fujii,
smashed him up and yet now he's fine!

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:50.710
That's so creepy!

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:57.640
Listen, the Fujii here right now
isn't the real Fujii.

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:59.090
Then what is he?

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.390
A monster!

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:06.890
A monster?

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.160
Yakumo!

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.800
Monkey, please hear
what I have to say.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:14.900
Forgive me!
I'm sorry!

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.010
I didn't mean to tell everybody!

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.840
Listen to me! I'm not really...

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.300
Somebody help!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.720
It seems I've no choice
but to leave?

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.290
Yakumo!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.300
What're you doing Yakumo?

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.900
What am I doing?!
What are you doing here?!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.960
Pai wants to go to school.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:47.060
Go to school and make
a gang of friends like Yakumo.

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:53.200
You haven't a clue
what this is like for me.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.510
Yakumo?

00:15:58.580 --> 00:15:59.710
Stop babbling!

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:04.760
Thanks to you
I lost all of my friends!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:12.430
You won't lose your friends.
There are lots of friends at school.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.490
Pai is going to school, OK.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:16.360
Hey, Pai!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.390
Yakumo!
Come to school too!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.810
I may have said too much?

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.170
Well that's it.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.070
I have to find the Statue of Humanity
and become human again...

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.910
before I can return.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.920
At least I can say
good bye to them.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:38.710
You had three eyes, didn't you?

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.780
You're the girl from the photo!

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:42.720
What?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.760
You're from Yakumo's gang,
aren't you?

00:17:45.820 --> 00:17:46.720
Yes...

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.420
I'm Pai.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.790
What's happened to Yakumo?

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:55.100
You know something, don't you?

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.130
Pai...

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.340
Natsuko...

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.470
What's going on
with you and Yakumo?

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.140
P... Pai is just...

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.100
Do you care about
Yakumo so much?

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.720
Yes I do.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:18.750
Why?
What do you think of Yakumo?

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:20.380
Yakumo?

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:26.830
He's a slave.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.900
A slave?

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:37.600
Throughout the centuries, our race
has had access to powerful magic.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:41.240
However, each time we use our
powers we are forced to rest.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.610
During this time
we cannot defend ourselves.

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:48.750
The immortal Wu is merely
a tool for our protection.

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.020
She can't be serious!

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:55.450
Then find someone who's
a better fighter to become your Wu.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:58.730
Change Fujii back to normal.
I'm begging you!

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:01.330
What the?

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:06.240
Does Pai...

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.270
Yakumo!

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:11.370
Does Pai also
think of me as a slave?

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.330
Fujii.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.430
Natsuko.

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.110
I won't become a slave!

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:26.860
Pai!

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:58.780
Natsuko!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.810
- What's that?
- A monster!

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.240
Natsuko!!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.920
Bastard!
You're still alive?

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:41.890
I shall become Wu
and thus become immortal.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:45.030
But not powerless
and pathetic, like you.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.450
Restore Natsuko you bastard!

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:01.910
She'll stay this way until I die.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:02.980
Shit!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:11.690
I'll rip you into so many pieces
you won't be able to regenerate.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:35.280
I'm going to tear you apart.

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:08.250
S... Sanjiyan.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:09.820
Takuhi!

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:19.730
And... Natsuko?

00:22:22.430 --> 00:22:23.130
Why?

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:25.640
Why didn't she
change back to normal?

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:31.010
Fool!
That was my alter ego.

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:32.140
What?

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:35.580
I have bonded myself to this girl.

00:22:42.850 --> 00:22:43.840
Natsuko!

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:47.390
Her life is solely in my hands.

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:50.320
If you wish to save her,
then make me a Wu.

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:53.690
I can't.
I don't have the power!

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:56.890
Then make the Sanjiyan do it.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:06.140
What are you waiting for?
She's going to die soon.

00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:07.210
Stop it!

00:23:07.450 --> 00:23:10.040
Sanjiyan!
Please make him immortal!

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:15.550
No way.
Who would want this lowlife for a Wu?

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:18.750
Sanjiyan!
You must save Natsuko!

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:21.220
You dare to order me?

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:28.720
Please!

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.590
I don't care what happens to me!

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:32.130
Please save Natsuko!

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:33.430
Please!

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:41.070
Whether she lives or dies
has nothing to do with me.

00:23:56.890 --> 00:23:58.380
Hey, you monster!

00:23:58.600 --> 00:24:00.590
Consume my immortal body!

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.890
Bond to me! Take me!

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:06.300
Very well!

00:24:11.780 --> 00:24:13.300
Fujii!

00:24:13.980 --> 00:24:15.100
Yakumo!

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:23.010
Goodbye, everyone...
Goodbye, Pai.

00:24:39.740 --> 00:24:40.900
Fool!

00:24:41.070 --> 00:24:44.440
You're my slave, can't you do
any better than this?

00:24:45.180 --> 00:24:47.010
S... Sanjiyan...

00:25:21.750 --> 00:25:24.340
I'm sorry for getting
everyone involved in this.

00:25:24.850 --> 00:25:27.040
I'm going to leave
Japan immediately.

00:25:37.060 --> 00:25:38.360
Let's go, Pai.

00:25:40.430 --> 00:25:42.190
Pai knows these people.

00:25:43.630 --> 00:25:45.600
They're the people from that photo.

00:25:45.940 --> 00:25:48.430
Yakumo's gang of friends, right?

00:25:51.210 --> 00:25:52.110
Pai...

00:25:52.840 --> 00:25:54.000
That's true.

00:25:56.750 --> 00:25:59.180
We're all friends, best friends.

00:25:59.580 --> 00:26:01.180
That's right, isn't it?

00:26:02.090 --> 00:26:03.280
Natsuko.

00:26:03.960 --> 00:26:04.890
Yeah.

00:26:07.090 --> 00:26:08.720
We're all friends.

00:26:10.230 --> 00:26:12.160
I'm sorry Yakumo.

00:26:17.600 --> 00:26:21.830
With that, Pai and I
left on our journey.

00:26:25.140 --> 00:26:29.910
But now, I'm no longer sure what
the Sanjiyan really thinks of me.

00:26:32.320 --> 00:26:33.780
Good luck!
Take care of yourself!

00:26:33.850 --> 00:26:34.980
Do your best!

00:26:35.050 --> 00:26:37.380
Hurry up and become human
so you can come back!

00:26:38.620 --> 00:26:39.520
Jeez!

00:26:43.030 --> 00:26:46.490
Pai will become human soon and
then wants to make lots of friends.

00:26:47.500 --> 00:26:48.290
Pai.

00:26:49.530 --> 00:26:55.300
And yet, somehow both
the terrible Sanjiyan and Pai...

00:26:58.680 --> 00:27:00.510
well... I like them.

00:28:46.580 --> 00:28:48.640
It won't stop!

00:28:58.030 --> 00:28:59.430
The Statue of Humanity...

00:29:06.870 --> 00:29:09.310
I will never die!!

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:22.420
Yakumo, protect
Pai with your body...

00:29:22.720 --> 00:29:25.810
and Pai will wager her life on you.
